049700         MOVE REQ-ARG  TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
049800         MOVE "Y" TO FATAL-ERR-SW
049900         GO TO 64-PR-X.
050000
050100     MOVE SPACES            TO  DE-FIELDS.
