050300     MOVE REQITM-QTY-TO-ORD TO  DISP-REQ-QTY.
050400     MOVE 4                 TO  DATE-MODE.
050500     MOVE REQ-DATE-WANTED   TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
050600     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
050700     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT    TO  DISP-DATE-WANTED.
050800     MOVE REQ-CO            TO  DISP-REQ-CO.
050900     MOVE REQ-PRIME         TO  DISP-REQ-PRIME.
051000     MOVE REQ-SUB           TO  DISP-REQ-SUB.
051100     MOVE REQ-SUBD          TO  DISP-REQ-SUBD.
051200     MOVE REQ-ADDTL-DATA    TO  DISP-REQ-ADDTL-DATA.
051300
051400 64-CHECK-FOR-BLANKETS.
051500
051600********************************************
051700*                                          *
051800*  CHECK IF THIS CODE IS ON A BLANKET BY   *
051900*  CALLING SUBROUTINE 'TCHKBLKT'. IT WILL  *
052000*  RETURN THREE PIECES OF INFORMATION      *
052100*    1) TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT IS THE TOTAL   *
052200*     NUMBER OF BLANKETS THAT EXIST BOTH   *
052300*     UNEXPIRED AND EXPIRED.               *
052400*    2) UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT IS THE TOTAL  *
052500*     NUMBER OF UNEXPIRED BLANKET ORDERS   *
052600*     THAT EXIST.                          *
052700*    3) FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLKT CONTAINS THE  *
052800*     ACTUAL PO NUMBER OF THE FIRST        *
052900*     UNEXPIRED BLANKET THAT IS FOUND.     *
053000*                                          *
053100********************************************
053200
053300     MOVE SPACES     TO  FIRST-UNEXPIRED-BLKT
                               R11-SMALL-PO
                               R11-LARGE-PO.
053400     MOVE ZEROS      TO  TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT,
053500                         UNEXPIRED-BLKT-COUNT.
053600     CALL "TCHKBLKT" USING BASE,
053700                           CODE-ARG,
053800                           CHKBLKT-PARMS.
053900
054000     IF TOTAL-BLANKET-COUNT > 0
054100         MOVE BLKT-MSG       TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG
054200         MOVE "Y"                  TO  F1-VALID-SW
054300     ELSE
054400         MOVE SPACES         TO  DISP-BLKT-MSG
054500         MOVE "N"                  TO  F1-VALID-SW.
054600
054700 64-GET-MSTORERM.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-MSTORERM-CD-I.
055000     IF COND-WORD  NOT = 0
