055200         MOVE CODE-ARG  TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
055300         MOVE "Y" TO FATAL-ERR-SW
055400         GO TO 64-PR-X.
055500     MOVE COMPANY-SAVE       TO  DISP-SCREEN2-COMP.
055600     MOVE MREQ-NUMBER        TO  DISP-REQ-NO.
055700     MOVE 4                  TO  DATE-MODE.
055800     MOVE REQ-DATE           TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
055900     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
056000     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT     TO  DISP-REQDATE.
056100     IF REQ-RELEASE-STAT = "XX"
