057400     MOVE ST-CLASS           TO  DISP-CLASS.
057500     MOVE STR-UM             TO  DISP-UM.
057600     MOVE STR-ONHAND         TO  DISP-ONHAND.
057700     MOVE STR-EOQ            TO  DISP-EOQ.
057800     MOVE STR-UM1            TO  DISP-UM1.
057900     MOVE STR-UM1-CF         TO  DISP-UM1-CONV.
