061200              MOVE STR-MKT-COST  TO  DISP-MKT-AVG-COST
061300         ELSE
061400              MOVE "AVG COST"    TO  DISP-MKT-OR-AVG-LIT
061500              MOVE STR-AVG-COST  TO  DISP-MKT-AVG-COST
061600     ELSE
061700         MOVE "MKT COST"         TO  DISP-MKT-OR-AVG-LIT
061800         MOVE STR-MKT-COST       TO  DISP-MKT-AVG-COST.
061900     MOVE STR-MTH-FCST    TO  DISP-MTH-ISSUE.
