076000 64-LOAD-USAGE.
076100     MOVE USAGE-FILENUMBER  TO  FILENUMBER.
076200     MOVE CODE-ARG          TO KEY-VALUE.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-USAGEFIL-CD-I.
076500     IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "0"
076600         MOVE "CKREADBYKEY ERR MS3F" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
076700         MOVE KSAM-STATUS            TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (1)
076800         MOVE KEY-VALUE         TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
076900         MOVE "Y"                    TO FATAL-ERR-SW
077000         GO TO 64-PR-X.
           PERFORM 641-LOAD-STR-USE THRU 641-LOAD-STR-USE-X.
079800
